{"thread":{"threadID":3912,"boardID":121,"topic":"Command Bugg.","time":1478954276,"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","lastPostTime":1479325770,"lastPoster":"Mike","replies":5,"views":25,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":0},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":51994,"threadID":3912,"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","subject":"Command Bugg.","time":1478954276,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hallöchen zusammen,<br>Undzwar geht es darum, dass wir einen Command Bugg gefunden haben, sobald man den Command !ban [Spieler] eingibt, verschwinden die Waffen sowie das Knife vom Spieler.<br>Sprich, der Spieler steht mit leeren Händen da.<br>Sollte schnellstmöglich behoben werden, damit ich wieder in ruhe CT spielen kann.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":51995,"threadID":3912,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1478956469,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ja und? <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span> Wenn du ihn eh bannen willst ist es doch egal <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ban halt einfach übers menü <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":51996,"threadID":3912,"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","subject":"","time":1478956668,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Mike</strong></cite><p>Ja und? <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span> Wenn du ihn eh bannen willst ist es doch egal <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ban halt einfach übers menü <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span><br></p></blockquote><p>Es geht darum, dass man die Person nicht bannt, und somit der Befehlt nicht das tut, was es eigentlich tuen